<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Maxell - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Maxell - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 57.42		vs	   50.17</p>
<p> Operating	    1.92		vs	  557 million</p>
<p> Current		3.29		vs	    2.06</p>
<p> Net		    2.40		vs	    1.94</p>
<p> EPS		   23.60 yen	  vs	   19.08 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    102 million	  vs	 102 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.50 yen	  vs	    8.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Maxell Ltd is a manufacturer of magnetic tapes for audio and VCR equipment.</p>
</text>
